9	<p>The graffiti in Chloe&rsquo;s room that stuck out the most to me. <br/>\n&ldquo;Just gotta let go&rdquo; another ominous quote that could have something to do with Chloe&rsquo;s immanent fate.<br/>\n&ldquo;Everybody lies, no exceptions&rdquo; her dad said he would come home, Rachel clearly hid a lot from chloe, and how many times has Max rewound just to say the right thing? How many times has Max decided not to tell Chloe something. Could this mean chloe has been lying too? Who knows.<br/>\n&ldquo;A hole to another universe&rdquo; I found this one cool because theoretically time travel creates alternate time lines or universes. I mean so far life is strange has already explored at least 2 known alternate universes and maybe more. The entire game stems from max saving chloe creating a time line where she lives. Most obvious though is the time line where max saves Chloe&rsquo;s dad only to cause her friend great pain. <br/>\nOk ramble done have a nice day~<br/>\nIf you like life is strange check out Geek Remix on YouTube.</p>	http://spritzeed.tumblr.com/post/129845590023/the-graffiti-in-chloes-room-that-stuck-out-the	\N	129845590023	tumblr	photo	\N	2015-09-25 13:43:48	2015-09-25 13:43:48	\N	\N	\N	"photos"=>"[{\\"caption\\":\\"\\",\\"alt_sizes\\":[{\\"url\\":\\"https://40.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_1280.jpg\\",\\"width\\":1280,\\"height\\":1280},{\\"url\\":\\"https://40.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_500.jpg\\",\\"width\\":500,\\"height\\":500},{\\"url\\":\\"https://41.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_400.jpg\\",\\"width\\":400,\\"height\\":400},{\\"url\\":\\"https://40.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_250.jpg\\",\\"width\\":250,\\"height\\":250},{\\"url\\":\\"https://41.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_100.jpg\\",\\"width\\":100,\\"height\\":100},{\\"url\\":\\"https://41.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_75sq.jpg\\",\\"width\\":75,\\"height\\":75}],\\"original_size\\":{\\"url\\":\\"https://40.media.tumblr.com/66daea62737ed97001c0feb7900933c9/tumblr_nv8jh1VIN51qddoqpo1_1280.jpg\\",\\"width\\":1280,\\"height\\":1280}}]", "origin_author_name"=>"spritzeed", "origin_author_username"=>""	2015-09-25 13:57:35.561099	2015-09-29 13:47:55.650062	f	The graffiti in Chloe’s room that stuck out the most to me.  \n“Just gotta let go” another ominous quote that could have something to do with Chloe’s immanent fate. \n“Everybody lies, no exceptions” her dad said he would come home, Rachel clearly hid a lot from chloe, and how many times has Max rewound just to say the right thing? How many times has Max decided not to tell Chloe something. Could this mean chloe has been lying too? Who knows. \n“A hole to another universe” I found this one cool because theoretically time travel creates alternate time lines or universes. I mean so far life is strange has already explored at least 2 known alternate universes and maybe more. The entire game stems from max saving chloe creating a time line where she lives. Most obvious though is the time line where max saves Chloe’s dad only to cause her friend great pain.  \nOk ramble done have a nice day~ \nIf you like life is strange check out Geek Remix on YouTube.  http://spritzeed.tumblr.com/post/129845590023/the-graffiti-in-chloes-room-that-stuck-out-the tumblr photo 	The graffiti in Chloe’s room that stuck out the most to me.  \n“Just gotta let go” another ominous quote that could have something to do with Chloe’s immanent fate. \n“Everybody lies, no exceptions” her dad said he would come home, Rachel clearly hid a lot from chloe, and how many times has Max rewound just to say the right thing? How many times has Max decided not to tell Chloe something. Could this mean chloe has been lying too? Who knows. \n“A hole to another universe” I fo